```

Hmm — order vs misuseNote/budgetLine appends: coalesce should run BEFORE those trailing single messages are appended (they're appended after). I'll place the coalesce right after the pairing repair block, before budgetLine.

One more consideration: after the cap heal with relieved == null, `continue` → rebuild request context with coalesce armed → retry. If the second attempt also fails with cap-400: `_needsCapHeal` false (capHealed) → falls through to pairing heal check → returns finished terminal. Good, AC3.

